DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The aaddmmtttt driver provides support for the Analog Devices ADM1031 tempera‐
     ture sensor.  The device possesses an internal and two external tempera‐
     ture sensors, plus two fan RPM monitors.  These values are made available
     through the sysctl(8) interface.

